{"speciesId":220,"names":{"fr":"Marcacrin","es":"Swinub","en":"Swinub","ja":"ウリムー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It rubs its snout on the ground to find and dig up food. It sometimes discovers hot springs."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If it smells some­ thing enticing, it dashes headlong off to find the source of the aroma."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It uses the tip of its nose to dig for food. Its nose is so tough that even frozen ground poses no problem."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SWINUB roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under the cover of dead grass. This POKéMON occasionally roots out hot springs."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SWINUB roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under the cover of dead grass. This POKéMON occasionally roots out hot springs."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under dried grass. It occasionally roots out hot springs."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"If it smells something enticing, it dashes off headlong to find the source of the aroma."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It rubs its snout on the ground to find and dig up food. It sometimes discovers hot springs."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It loves eating mushrooms that grow under dead grass. It also finds hot springs while foraging."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It loves eating mushrooms that grow under dead grass. It also finds hot springs while foraging."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a very sensitive nose. It can locate mushrooms, berries, and even hot springs buried under ice."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It rubs its snout on the ground to find 